#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:46
#: e00f6f92661f4e23b781cc5b65faeadf
msgid "Security and privacy"
msgstr "Securite et vie privee"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:48
#: e893941a957e46eaaefa68a3bdeb1d34
msgid ""
"Scholarium organizes and publishes reviewed material; it is not an academic,"
" legal, or taxonomic authority."
msgstr ""
"Scholarium organise et publie du materiel revise; il n'est pas une autorite "
"academique, juridique ou taxonomique."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:50
#: d75ad1aaf6394060b3db0a57dc413e67
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuer"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:52
#: 4e18b35b85bc435196c7be3dcecd15b6
msgid ""
"Read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md`, and the repository "
"license when present. Keep changes bounded and include the checks that "
"justify acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Lisez `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md` et la licence du depot "
"lorsqu'ils existent. Gardez les changements bornes et incluez les controles "
"qui justifient leur acceptation."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:54
#: 53c0751c078940649305ff15e6636503
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "Versions publiees"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/operations.md:56
#: 647cba9870ed4f3c8e4280bde61297ff
msgid ""
"The current public documentation describes `pre-alpha` with status `public-"
"pre-alpha`. Consult the repository history and release notes for changes."
msgstr ""
"La documentation publique actuelle decrit `pre-alpha` avec le statut "
"`public-pre-alpha`. Consultez l'historique du depot et les notes de version "
"pour les changements."
